id: draft-json-parser-1.1.0-makefile-wildcard-in-source-build
title: Makefile 用 $(wildcard *.c) 取源文件的库在 conan out-of-source 构建下 json.o 缺失，需配方侧强制源内构建（folders.build = "."）
trigger_tool: conan create / make / llvm-ar / ar
phase: compilation
error_signature: llvm-ar: error: .*\.o: No such file or directory|ar: .*\.o: No such file|.*\.o: No such file or directory
severity: 3
category: conan|build-system|makefile|autotools
match_keywords: wildcard, $(wildcard *.c), SRCS, OBJS, out-of-source, build-release, folders.build, json.o, llvm-ar, source build
keywords: wildcard, $(wildcard *.c), SRCS, OBJS, out-of-source, build-release, folders.build, json.o, llvm-ar, source build
root_cause: Makefile.in 用 $(wildcard *.c) 在 make 当前工作目录展开取源；Conan 默认 out-of-source 构建（build-release/ 子目录）使 make 运行目录无 .c 文件，SRCS/OBJS 为空，归档规则中的字面量 .o 从未编译，llvm-ar/ar 报缺文件
rec_approach: recipe layout() 中设置 self.folders.build = "."（源内构建），使 wildcard 在 source 目录展开；与 abc/abduco 等既有配方一致
verification_cmd: conan create <pkg> --build=missing 后检查日志出现 clang -c xxx.c 编译行与归档成功；W3 build_and_test.sh L0-L5 通过
applies_to: conan 配方 + Makefile 用 $(wildcard *.c) 的库（autotools/裸 Makefile）
counter_example: automake 等支持 VPATH/out-of-source 的构建系统无需源内构建，强制 folders.build="." 反而污染源码目录
limitations: 判定需先确认日志缺 .o 且无对应编译行（wildcard 取源为空），而非 ar 参数本身错误
